      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/QCGov/status/2003116134242136501",
      "text": "Paskong masaya, Paskong QC! ✨\n\nPatuloy sa paghahatid ng iba-ibang serbisyo at programa ang lokal na pamahalaan para sa ating QCitizens ngayong papalapit na ang Pasko.\n\nPanoorin ang weekly recap na ito para sa linggo ng December 15, 2025. Makikita ang iba pang detalye sa:\n\n• Pangkabuhayang QC Training and Payout Phase 5 (Batch 2):\n\nhttps://t.co/7w9cUPlQ3m\n\nhttps://t.co/otz945hiII\n\n• Fire assistance to fire victims - Brgy. Culiat:\n\nhttps://t.co/zyWVdXLDAr\n\n• Upskilling Tech-Voc Training Program:\n\nhttps://t.co/inMeAyU2eI\n\n• Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program (4Ps):\n\nhttps://t.co/uLlluTX79X\n\n• QC Inclusivity Partners Recognition Day:\n\nhttps://t.co/C5IyHovU5g\n\n• Ceremonial MOA Signing with LINK Center for the Deaf Inc.:\n\nhttps://t.co/gt1s6311Y2\n\n• Micro, Small Enterprises, and Cooperatives (MSEC) Scale Up program:\n\nhttps://t.co/jC6FY4yz0f\n\n• Mayors for Good Governance (M4GG) Dialogue with DepEd  Sec. Sonny Angara:\n\nhttps://t.co/ukRsrjb74s\n\n• Ceremonial Lighting as part of the Community Electrification Program of One Meralco Foundation:\n\nhttps://t.co/KPjull8HS9\n\n• Public consultation with QC Health Department:\n\nhttps://t.co/lxwxciZap9\n\n• Search for Outstanding Volunteers Awarding Ceremony:\n\nhttps://t.co/AenZxKilIU\n\nhttps://t.co/h9LjTvicUc\n\n• Bayanihang QC: Volunteerism Expo 2025:\n\nhttps://t.co/CF1GoruVEC\n\n• Financial assistance under the Integrated Disaster Shelter Assistance Program of Department of Human Settlements and Urban Development (DHSUD)\n\nhttps://t.co/1vwt5Q1662\n\n• 150th Birth Anniversary of Emilio Jacinto:\n\nhttps://t.co/5WbOM9fBuY\n\n• Energy Efficiency Excellence (EEE) Awards by the Department of Energy: \n\nhttps://t.co/raYRjb3RAT\n\nhttps://t.co/zqHLhGthkc\n\n• QC Performing Arts Development Foundation Inc. (PADFI) 1st place at the 12th Cheerleading World Championships (CWC): \n\nhttps://t.co/JOJNMjgBre\n\n• Quezon City University (QCU) - Commission on Higher Education’s Internationalization Champions of Nation-Building and Sustainability (ICONS) Awards 2025: \n\nhttps://t.co/0w7FKxKfhl\n\n#BusyQCWeeklyRecap",
